# QUESTION: two complete alternate answers. Individual takes are never mixed.
line=saint_denis.recorded_question.take_a|sd_recorded_question_a_01|THE VAMPIRE|nw.sd.opening.names.a|nw.audio.sd.opening.names.a|2800|Men have given me many names.
line=saint_denis.recorded_question.take_a|sd_recorded_question_a_02|THE VAMPIRE|nw.sd.opening.name_matter.a|nw.audio.sd.opening.name_matter.a|4000|None of those men lived long enough to make one matter.
line=saint_denis.recorded_question.take_b|sd_recorded_question_b_01|THE VAMPIRE|nw.sd.opening.names.b|nw.audio.sd.opening.names.b|3150|Men have given me many names.
